sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AuthorResource
    participant AuthorService
    participant JPA
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Author
    participant Post
    participant ResourceExceptionHandler

    Client->>AuthorResource: GET /authors/{id}
    AuthorResource->>AuthorService: findById(id)
    AuthorService->>JPA: find(Author.class, id)
    Note over JPA: Query Author by ID from database
    JPA->>PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM author WHERE id = ?

    alt Author found
        PostgreSQL-->>JPA: return author row
        Note over JPA: ResultSet - Author record from database
        JPA->>Author: instantiate and populate Author
        Note over JPA: JPA loads entity into persistence context
        JPA-->>AuthorService: return Author
        AuthorService-->>AuthorResource: return author

        opt if posts accessed
            AuthorResource->>Author: getPosts()
            Note over AuthorResource: Lazy load posts collection on access
            Author->>JPA: initialize lazy collection
            JPA->>PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM post WHERE author_id = ?
            PostgreSQL-->>JPA: return post rows
            JPA->>Post: instantiate Post entities
            JPA-->>Author: return posts
        end

        AuthorResource-->>Client: ResponseEntity.ok(author)
        Note over AuthorResource: HTTP 200 with Author object
    else Author not found
        PostgreSQL-->>JPA: SELECT returns empty result
        JPA-->>AuthorService: return null or Optional.empty
        AuthorService->>ResourceExceptionHandler: throw ObjectNotFoundException
        ResourceExceptionHandler-->>Client: ResponseEntity with 404 Not Found
    end
